---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Birky Studio collects, uses and protects your personal information on birkystudio.com.">
  <section style="padding:100px 0 24px">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);color:white;margin-bottom:16px;text-transform:uppercase;">Privacy <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--bs-accent);">Policy</em></h1>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;">Effective date: October 27, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding:24px 0 100px">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">

      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;font-size:1.05rem;">Birky Studio builds websites and AI agents for small businesses. This policy explains what personal information we collect through birkystudio.com, why we collect it, and what you can do about it. If anything here is unclear, write to us at birky.ai@proton.me and we will explain.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">1. What We Collect</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;"><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Information you give us.</strong> When you use the contact form, the WhatsApp link, or email us, we receive your name, your email address, your phone number if you add it, and whatever you tell us about your business. The contact form on this site does not store anything on our servers: it opens WhatsApp on your device with your message pre-filled, and the conversation happens there.</p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;margin-top:14px;"><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Booking information.</strong> If you book a call, the booking is handled by Calendly, which collects your name, your email and the time you chose.</p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;margin-top:14px;"><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, ours records how visitors use it: pages viewed, the site you arrived from, an approximate location derived from your IP address, your browser and device type, and how long you stayed.</p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;margin-top:14px;"><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Session recordings and heatmaps.</strong> We use Microsoft Clarity to record anonymised browsing sessions so we can see where visitors get stuck and fix it.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">2. How We Use It</h2>
      <ul style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;padding-left:22px;">
        <li>to answer your enquiry and quote your project</li>
        <li>to schedule and hold calls with you</li>
        <li>to understand which pages are useful and improve the site</li>
        <li>to keep records of the work we do for you</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">3. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">We use three measurement tools:</p>
      <ul style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;padding-left:22px;margin-top:14px;">
        <li><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Google Analytics 4</strong> (Google LLC) measures traffic and behaviour, and sets cookies such as <code>_ga</code>.</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Microsoft Clarity</strong> (Microsoft Corporation) produces heatmaps and session recordings.</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--bs-text);">Vercel Analytics</strong> (Vercel Inc.) counts traffic in aggregate, without advertising cookies.</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;margin-top:14px;">We do not run advertising pixels and we do not sell data. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, and the site will still work.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">4. Who We Share It With</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">Only with the services that make the site run. Each one processes data under its own privacy policy:</p>
      <ul style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;padding-left:22px;margin-top:14px;">
        <li>Google LLC, for Analytics 4: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">policies.google.com/privacy</a></li>
        <li>Microsoft Corporation, for Clarity: <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">privacy.microsoft.com</a></li>
        <li>Vercel Inc., for hosting and analytics: <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy</a></li>
        <li>Calendly LLC, for call booking: <a href="https://calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice</a></li>
        <li>Meta Platforms, for WhatsApp messaging: <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy</a></li>
        <li>Vapi, for voice agents we operate on behalf of clients: <a href="https://vapi.ai/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">vapi.ai/privacy</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">5. Client Projects</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">When we build an AI agent or a website for a client, that client owns the data the system handles and we act on their instructions. Their own privacy policy governs that data, not this one.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">6. How Long We Keep It</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">Enquiries that do not become projects are kept for up to 12 months. Records for client projects are kept for as long as we work together, plus any period the law requires. Analytics data is kept according to the retention settings of the providers listed above.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">You can ask us to show you what we hold about you, to correct it, or to delete it, and you can ask us to stop contacting you. Email <a href="mailto:birky.ai@proton.me" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">birky.ai@proton.me</a> and we will respond within 30 days. You also have the right to complain to your local data protection authority.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">8. Children</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">Our services are for businesses. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 16.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">9. Security</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">The site runs over an encrypted connection (HTTPS) and we keep access to our own accounts to a minimum. No system is perfect. If a breach ever affects you, we will tell you.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">10. Changes</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">If this policy changes, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;">11. Contact</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;">Birky Studio, Antigua Guatemala.<br>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/50234775110" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">+502 3477 5110</a><br>Email: <a href="mailto:birky.ai@proton.me" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">birky.ai@proton.me</a></p>

      <p style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);line-height:1.9;margin-top:44px;font-size:0.95rem;">Leer esta política en <a href="/es/privacidad" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">español</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
